msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Wielt d'Adressbicher fir mat der Telefonie ze benotzen an arrangéiert se an "
"der Prioritéit. Dat iewescht Adressbuch huet déi héchst Prioritéit a gëtt "
"bevorzugt wann eng Nummer a méi Adressbicher fonnt gëtt. Dir kënnt den "
"Duplicate Resolver Toggle hei ënnen benotze fir Duplikate ze managen, awer "
"och wann et behënnert ass, encouragéiere mir et fir eng besser Erfahrung "
"z'aktivéieren."

msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Wann aktivéiert, wann déi selwecht Telefonsnummer Iech 3 Mol bannent 5 "
"Minutten rufft, wäert den drëtten Uruff (a spéider an der Fënster) den "
"Telefon forcéieren fir op maximal Volumen ze ruffen, andeems d'Stille oder "
"d'Modi net stéieren."

msgid ""
