msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts"
" below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"Kontakter kënnen eng Aktioun ausléisen andeems Dir eng geheim SMS Message "
"schéckt. Füügt Kontakter hei drënner a setzt hir geheime Ausléiser Ausdrock."

msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their"
" secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Vertraute Kontakter kënnen Är Positioun ufroen andeems se eng geheim SMS-"
"Noriicht schécken. TOTP ass obligatoresch fir datt dës Funktioun "
"funktionéiert. Füügt Kontakter hei drënner derbäi a setzt hire geheime "
"Ausléiser-Ausdrock. Beispill Schabloun: 'SECRET TOTP' Real Liewen Beispill: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"

msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Vertraute Kontakter kënne roueg e Réckruff ausléisen andeems se eng geheim "
"SMS-Noriicht schécken. TOTP ass obligatoresch fir datt dës Funktioun "
"funktionéiert. Füügt Kontakter hei drënner derbäi a setzt hire geheime "
"Ausléiser-Ausdrock. Beispill Schabloun: 'SECRET TOTP' Real Liewen Beispill: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"

msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Vertraute Kontakter kënnen e SMS-Relais schécken. TOTP ass obligatoresch fir"
" datt dës Funktioun funktionéiert. Füügt Kontakter hei drënner derbäi a "
"setzt hire geheime Ausléiser-Ausdrock. Beispill Schabloun: 'SECRET TOTP "
"+1234567890 MESSAGE' Real Liewen Beispill: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 "
"Hello'"

msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Vertraute Kontakter kënnen eng tmate SSH Sessioun starten an d'SSH-"
"Zougangszeeche kréien andeems se eng geheim SMS-Noriicht schécken. TOTP ass "
"obligatoresch fir datt dës Funktioun funktionéiert. Füügt Kontakter hei "
"drënner derbäi a setzt hire geheime Ausléiser-Ausdrock. Beispill Schabloun: "
"'SECRET TOTP' Real Liewen Beispill: 'Gorilla 123456'"

msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can wipe your device. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to"
" work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Vertraute Kontakter kënnen Ären Apparat wëschen. TOTP ass obligatoresch fir "
"datt dës Funktioun funktionéiert. Füügt Kontakter hei drënner derbäi a setzt"
" hire geheime Ausléiser-Ausdrock. Beispill Schabloun: 'SECRET TOTP "
"SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real Liewen Beispill: 'Gorilla "
"123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

